 "intro_zh": "清西陵是清朝最后一处帝王陵墓群。清西陵以14座陵寝为主，行宫、永福寺、营房、衙署为辅的83平方公里的广袤陵区，是现存规模宏大、保存最完整、陵寝建筑类型最齐全的古代皇家陵墓群。景点主要有泰陵、昌西陵、慕陵、崇陵、永福寺。2000年被列入《世界文化遗产名录》。",
 "intro_en": "The Western Qing tombs (Chinese: 清西陵; pinyin: Qīng Xī líng; Manchu: ᠸᠠᡵᡤᡳ ᡝᡵᡤᡳ ᠮᡠᠩᡤᠠᠨ, romanized: wargi ergi munggan) are located some 140 km (87 mi) southwest of Beijing in Yi County, Hebei Province. They constitute a necropolis that incorporates four royal mausoleums where seventy-eight royal members are buried. These include four emperors of the Qing dynasty and their empresses, imperial concubines, princes and princesses, as well as other royal servants.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
